{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24671","headline":"开龙门八节石滩诗二首 一 · 白居易","name":"开龙门八节石滩诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铁凿金鎚殷若雷，八滩九石劒棱摧。\n竹篙桂檝飞如箭，百筏千艘鱼贯来。\n振锡导师凭衆力，挥金退傅施家财。\n他时相逐西方去，莫虑尘沙路不开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}